<title>UK: UK's Ofwat to announce early price review - FT.</title>
<headline>UK's Ofwat to announce early price review - FT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's water industry regulator Ofwat will on Tuesday announce a review of prices five years ahead of schedule, the Financial Times reported.</p>
<p>Ofwat chief Ian Byatt is expected to announce a mid-term price review to take place in 1999.</p>
<p>Last year, caps on price which water and sewerage companies are allowed to charge were set for the 10-year period to 2004.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
